  "schema:description": "This dataset contains data collected during the 2019 agricultural season in the Nile Delta (Egypt). The experiment was conducted in pilot fields at the pilot farm Sakha (North Nile Delta) under traditional flooding (WFL) using both fresh water and drainage water. Three cultivation methods were tested (drill seeding, raised beds, and the System of Rice Intensification), along with five rice varieties (Giza 177, Giza 178, Sakha 107, Hybrid Rice-EH1, and Dry Rice-L1). The dataset also includes the experimental field layouts and details of the cultivated rice varieties.",
